{"id":921930,"title":"22｜五个步骤：快速搭建本地知识库","content":"尹会生介绍了如何使用Cherry Studio快速搭建本地知识库，以支持RAG系统。首先，选择合适的Embedding模型如千问三8B模型，将其集成到Cherry Studio中，实现文本向量化。接着，对文档进行结构化整理并添加标签，创建独立的知识库，避免内容混杂导致搜索效率降低。随后，通过常见问题测试验证知识库的准确性和实用性。最后，建立维护机制，确保知识库的实时性、准确性和可追溯性，定期更新和审核文档，引入版本控制。整个过程简化了RAG系统的构建，提高了文档管理和搜索效率。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":405081,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769870135,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"这是联网本地知识库？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":405080,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769870080,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"8B的嵌入模型不小了吧？比bg系列大","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":405077,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769862702,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"比dify或者ragflow怎么样？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1687145,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/be/69/c2ecf377.jpg","nickname":"匙亮旭","note":"","ucode":"09A8C132BDFADA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677970,"discussion_content":"单纯